# Watchman probe files. Watchman drops one in the root of any watched tree,
# waits for the filesystem event to travel back, then deletes it — a lifetime of
# milliseconds. Harmless until a `git add -A` lands inside that window, which is
# how one nearly reached a commit on 2026-08-21.
.watchman-cookie-*
